Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
URL: https://github.com/JanWein/solvency2rfr
BugReports: https://github.com/JanWein/solvency2rfr/issues
